@startuml
!theme cyborg
skinparam backgroundColor #111827
skinparam defaultFontName Arial
skinparam defaultFontColor #F3F4F6
skinparam ArrowColor #CBD5E1
skinparam shadowing false
title Usability Session, Findings and Retest
start
:Select in-scope journey, criteria and review questions;
:Identify prototype / candidate and limitations;
:Prepare synthetic actor/grants, content and resettable state;
:Explain voluntary session and evidence handling;
:Give a task goal without prescribing clicks;
:Observe choices, understanding, outcome and help needed;
:Ask neutral follow-up and record limitations;
:Separate usability friction, accessibility defect
and functional / authority failure;
if (Finding requires change?) then (yes)
 :Record reproduction, impact, evidence and owner;
 :Refine affected design / implementation;
 :Retest affected journey on identified revision;
else (no)
 :Record bounded observations without broad pass claim;
endif
:Link evidence, unresolved work and criterion coverage;
stop
@enduml
